  title: "Duty Handover Log"
  body: "Thursday night handover:\nThe main door key is in the left drawer at the front desk \u2014 swipe the staff card to open it.\nThe staff card is locked in the security cabinet in the electrical room. Don't take it home.\nLeave the sculpture hall camera alone.\n\n(In the margin, in another hand:)\nThe duty room door is a maglock. It opens by itself when the power goes. Fire regs. Stop reporting it."
  hand: 3
